Error [E0961]: fan-out `.[` needs a one-argument function, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/fan_out_bad_callee.jet:3:10
    |
  3 |     _ #= x.[1, 2]
    |          ^
 Why: `f.[a, b, c]` expands to `[f(a), f(b), f(c)]` — `f` must accept exactly one argument
 Fix: use a one-argument function as the fan-out callee
